{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32917","headline":"长安夜访澈上人 · 李郢","name":"长安夜访澈上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关西木落夜霜凝，乌帽闲寻紫阁僧。\n松迥月光先照鹤，寺寒沟水忽生冰。\n琤琤晓漏喧秦禁，漠漠秋烟起汉陵。\n闻说天台旧禅处，石房独有一龛灯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}